bers, decimal conversion):\n\nGroup 1: FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN body 50, cartr 80, drums \"7 / 1\", control 0.02, bearings 3x6x3 / 2x5x2 / 3x8x4 / 3x6x3:\n1. G100: qmax160, qt32, qmin 8/5/3, blade 55/12\n2. G160: 250, 50, 12.5/8/5, blade 45/14\n3. G250: 400, 80, 20/12.5/8, blade 35/16\n\nGroup 2: FMT-L, FMT-S, FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN 80/80, drums 7/1, control 0.02, bearings 3x6x3/2x5x2/3x8x4/3x6x3:\n4. G100: 160, 32, 8/5/3, 55/12\n5. G160: 250, 50, 12.5/8/5, 45/14\n6. G250: 400, 80, 20/12.5/8, 35/16\n\nGroup 3: FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN 80/100, drums 7/1, control 0.02, bearings 3x8x4/3x6x3/5x10x3/3x6x3:\n7. G160: 250, 50, 12.5/8/5, 55/12\n8. G250: 400, 80, 20/12.5/8, 45/14\n9. G400: 650, 130, 32.5/20/12.5, 35/16\n\nGroup 4: FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN 100/80, drums 7/1, control 0.02, bearings 3x6x3/2x5x2/3x8x4/3x6x3:\n10. G100: 160, 32, 8/5/3, 55/12\n11. G160: 250, 50, 12.5/8/5, 45/14\n12. G250: 400, 80, 20/12.5/8, 35/16\n\nGroup 5: FMT-L, FMT-S, FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN 100/100, drums 7/1, control 0.02, bearings 3x8x4/3x6x3/5x10x3/3x6x3:\n13. G160: 250, 50, 12.5/8/5, 55/12\n14. G250: 400, 80, 20/12.5/8, 45/14\n15. G400: 650, 130, 32.5/20/12.5, 35/16\n\nGroup 6: FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN 100/150, bearings 5x11x5/5x11x5/5x16x5/5x11x5:\n16. G400: 650, 130, 32.5/20/12.5, drums 7/1, control 0.02, 55/12\n17. G650: 1000, 200, 50/32/20, drums 7/1, control 0.02, 45/14\n18. G1000: 1600, 320, 80/50/32, drums 8/0, control 0.2, 35/16\n\nGroup 7: FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN 150/100, drums 7/1, control 0.02, bearings 3x8x4/3x6x3/5x10x3/3x6x3:\n19. G160: 250, 50, 12.5/8/5, 55/12\n20. G250: 400, 80, 20/12.5/8, 45/14\n21. G400: 650, 130, 32.5/20/12.5, 35/16\n\nGroup 8: FMT-L, FMT-S, FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN 150/150, bearings 5x11x5/5x11x5/5x16x5/5x11x5:\n22. G400: 650, 130, 32.5/20/12.5, 7/1, 0.02, 55/12\n23. G650: 1000, 200, 50/32/20, 7/1, 0.02, 45/14\n24. G1000: 1600, 320, 80/50/32, 8/0, 0.2, 35/16\n\nGroup 9: FMT-Lx or FMT-Dc, DN 150/200, bearings 5x16x5/5x16x5/8x22x7/5x16x5:\n25. G650: 1000, 200, 50/32/20, drums 7/1,